For all the Scale's insistence on balance, its own workings are famously non-transparent — how directives are formed, and by whom, is not something the organisation cares to explain. Operatives such as [[Aaron Cross]] and [[Joran Davinrock]] move within that opacity, their specific roles undisclosed.
